  "name": "CHIMERA",
  "description": "Leakage-aware, reproducible virus-versus-host benchmark generator with random-fragment, genome-level, similarity-filtered, temporal, and taxonomic holdout protocols.",
  "abstract": "CHIMERA generates deterministic synthetic DNA-fragment evaluation bundles with auditable truth, source assignments, exclusions, provenance, and checksums. It generates benchmark data and does not train or validate a classifier.",
